  "assumptions": [
   "Power: about 1100 per arm (4400 total) to detect 1.7 points at 80% power; the observed effect was -2.3 (SE 0.995, n=641), and 1.7 allows for winner's-curse shrinkage.",
   "Wave 2 is fielded 2-4 weeks later with the same thermometer, undemocratic-practices and perceived-outparty items; recruit extra for attrition.",
   "Mediator: change in perceived outparty views, analyzed with a pre-registered mediation model.",
   "The platform lacks a slider type, so thermometer and perceived-outparty items use banded scales; a slider can replace them if the platform allows.",
   "Online panel, pre-registered, compensation per panel norms."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "The actual video files, wave 2 survey instrument and link, IRB approval number, and compensation must be supplied by the research team."
  ],
